			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 9500
			},
			"text": "それじゃだけど自分はアイリスで、イントンさんはまだシェルドンって言うか、お世話だったんだ。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:09,500",
				"to": "00:00:11,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 9500,
				"to": 11500
			},
			"text": "お世話だったんだ。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:11,500",
				"to": "00:00:14,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 11500,
				"to": 14500
			},
			"text": "だから、レベルはまだ前やって、トイトニー。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:14,500",
				"to": "00:00:17,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 14500,
				"to": 17500
			},
			"text": "あ、そうじゃない。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:17,500",
				"to": "00:00:19,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 17500,
				"to": 19500
			},
			"text": "あ、そうですか。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:19,500",
				"to": "00:00:21,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 19500,
				"to": 21500
			},
			"text": "これとか思って。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:21,500",
				"to": "00:00:23,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 21500,
				"to": 23500
			},
			"text": "まだ長居と。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:23,500",
				"to": "00:00:31,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 23500,
				"to": 31500
			},
			"text": "あの、えっと、お前後さんが今、トイトニーさんが一緒なのよ。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:31,500",
				"to": "00:00:32,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 31500,
				"to": 32500
			},
			"text": "あ、そう?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:32,500",
				"to": "00:00:34,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 32500,
				"to": 34500
			},
			"text": "長居さんって言うんだけどね。"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
